  "headline": "Atracurium besylate is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a plant classified OAI 258 days before the latest posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E12", "E10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include atracurium besylate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product used at both Corvale sites carries NDC 55150021710 and label set ID f7b6a720, which names Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited (FEI 3008461619) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant on 2026-02-06 and classified the inspection OAI; the classification was posted on 2026-09-21, 258 days before today.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier inspections of the same plant in 2024-02-02 and 2018-12-14 were also classified OAI and VAI respectively.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2024-08-15.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8.3 days of supply on hand while Corvale General has 25.5 days, so the rule‑based recommendation is to transfer 20 vials from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give Corvale East 14 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D4"]
    }
  ]
}
